🇩🇪🇷🇺⚡️ — NATO will strike Kaliningrad, the Kola Peninsula, St. Petersburg, and the Black Sea area in the event of a conflict with Russia, the commander of the German Air Force has stated.

In an interview with The Telegraph, he claims that Germany is ready to fight against Russia "as early as tonight".

